  "We call this place Omega Tower\nNo one's quite sure what it used to be.": {
    "val": "WE CALL DIS PLACE OMEGA TOWER\nNO ONE'S QUITE SURE WHAT IT USED TA BE!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "It’s massive: it extends into the clouds and \nburrows deep down into the bowels of earth. ": {
    "val": "IT’S MASSIVE: IT EXTENDS INTO DA CLOUDS AN' \nBURROWS DEEP DOWN INTO DA BOWELS OF EARTH! ",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Most likely a failed arcology project built \non anomalous and thaumaturgical principles. ": {
    "val": "MOST LIKELY A FAILED ARCOLOGY PROJECT BUILT \nON ANOMALOUS AN' THAUMATURGICAL PRINCIPLES! ",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "We've deployed probes for over a\nthousand floors in both directions. \nNo confirmed top...or bottom.": {
    "val": "WE HAB DEPLOYED PROBES FOR OVER A\nTHOUSAND FLOORS IN BOTH DIRECTIONS. \nNO CONFIRMED TOP...OR BOTTOM!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "The entrance is at the Hypernet Point. \nTake the elevator to Floor 0 then go to the\ndoor to the left.": {
    "val": "DA ENTRANCE IZ AT DA HYPERNET POINT. \nTAKE DA ELEVATOR TA FLOOR 0 DEN GO TA DA\nDOOR TA DA LEFT!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Once inside take the big central staircase\nand you can start exploring freely, just \nremember to stock up before an expedition.": {
    "val": "ONCE INSIDE TAKE DA BIG CENTRAL STAIRCASE\nAN' YOU CAN START EXPLORIN' FREELY, JUST \nREMEMBER TA STOCK UP BEFORE AN EXPEDITION!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Do you want me to take you there?": {
    "val": "DO YOU WANT ME TA TAKE YOU DERE?",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Ok, please follow me.": {
    "val": "OK, FOLLOW ME.",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Like everywere in the tower!\nAlmost every person here is a": {
    "val": "LIKE EVERYWHERE IN DA TOWER!\nALMOST EVERY PERSON HERE IZ A",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Some of them are willing to team up if your goals align.": {
    "val": "SOME OF DEM IZ WILLIN' TA TEAM UP IF YA GOALS ALIGN!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Its' dangerous to go alone!": {
    "val": "ITS' DANGEROUS TA GO ALONE!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Sometimes, when you’re exploring a floor or returning \nto base, you’ll run into other explorers and archivists.": {
    "val": "SOMETIMES, WHEN YOU’RE EXPLORIN' A FLOOR OR RETURNIN' \nTA BASE, YOU’LL RUN INTO OTHER EXPLORERS AN' ARCHIVISTS!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "If you want allies, talk to people around here. \nShare what you’ve found. \nThey’re more likely to trust someone who actually\ncontributes to the Archive. ": {
    "val": "IF YOU WANT ALLIES, TALK TA PEOPLE AROUND HERE. \nSHARE WHAT YOU’VE FOUND. \nDEY’RE MORE LIKELY TA TRUST SOMEONE WHO ACTUALLY\nCONTRIBUTES TA DA ARCHIVE! ",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "How the elevator works?": {
    "val": "HOW DA ELEVATOR WORKS?",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Why everybody talks so weird?": {
    "val": "WHY EVERYBODY TALKS SO WEIRD?",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "The Hypernet": {
    "val": "DA HYPERNET",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "The Squishing": {
    "val": "DA SQUISHING",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "It’s an anomalous construct, probably alive. ": {
    "val": "IT’S AN ANOMALOUS CONSTRUCT, MAYBE-MAYBE ALIVE! ",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Maybe even self-aware, though it won’t say\nanything directly.": {
    "val": "MAYBE EVEN SELF-AWARE, THOUGH IT WON’T SAY\nANYTINK DIRECTLY!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Here’s the tricky part. The elevator won’t take you\nsomewhere you haven’t been on foot.": {
    "val": "HERE’S DA TRICKY PART. DA ELEVATOR WON’T TAKE YOU\nSOMEWHERE YOU HAVEN’T BIN ON FOOT!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "If you want to reach a floor via elevator, \nyou’ve got to earn it first. ": {
    "val": "IF YOU WANT TA REACH A FLOOR VIA ELEVATOR, \nYOU’VE GOT TA EARN IT FIRST! ",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Strangely enough, a few high floors are unlocked right \nfrom the start. No one knows why. \nMight be just a design feature or it just wants to show off.": {
    "val": "STRANGELY ENOUGH, A FEW HIGH FLOORS IZ UNLOCKED RIGHT \nFROM DA START. NO ONE KNOWS WHY. \nMIGHT BE JUST A DESIGN FEATURE OR IT JUST WANTS TA SHOW OFF!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "It's called DungeonSpeak!": {
    "val": "IT IZ CALLED DungeonSpeak!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "It's a neolanguage based on the deconstruction\nand recostruction of English,": {
    "val": "IT IZ A NEOLANGUAGE BASED ON DA DECONSTRUCTION\nAN' RECONSTRUCTION OF ENGLISH,",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "The Hypernet isn’t what it used to be.": {
    "val": "DA HYPERNET ISN’T WHAT IT USED TA BE!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "It was destroyed during the Y2K Event, \nwhen something, something not from here, breached \ninto our layer of reality. We call it Omni-Lex.": {
    "val": "IT WAZ DESTROYED DURIN' DA Y2K EVENT, \nWHEN SOMETINK, SOMETINK NO FROM HERE, BREACHED \nINTO OUR LAYER OF REALITY. WE CALL IT OMNI-LEX!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "An extradimensional intelligence that decrypted \nevery password, breached every firewall, \nand made everything public.": {
    "val": "AN EXTRADIMENSIONAL INTELLIGENCE DAT DECRYPTED \nEVERY PASSWORD, BREACHED EVERY FIREWALL, \nAN' MADE EVERYTINK PUBLIC!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "The Hypernet couldn’t survive full transparency.": {
    "val": "DA HYPERNET COULDN’T SURVIVE FULL TRANSPARENCY!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "In the aftermath, the Foundation did what \nit always does, salvage and rebuild.": {
    "val": "IN DA AFTERMATH, DA FOUNDATION DID WHAT \nIT ALWAYS DOES, SALVAGE AN' REBUILD!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "What’s left of the Hypernet now is fragile, patchy, \nand deeply weird. We’re trying to reconstruct \nit from recovered HTML files, old hard drives, \nforgotten caches. ": {
    "val": "WHAT’S LEFT OF DA HYPERNET NOW IZ FRAGILE, PATCHY, \nAN' DEEPLY WEIRD. WE’RE TRYIN' TA RECONSTRUCT \nIT FROM RECOVERED HTML FILES, OLD HARD DRIVES, \nFORGOTTEN CACHES! ",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "Most links are broken. Images are missing. \nHexScript's practically radioactive. But sometimes, \nburied in the markup, we find data worth keeping.": {
    "val": "MOST LINKS IZ BROKEN. IMAGES IZ MISSIN'. \nHexScript'S PRACTICALLY RADIOACTIVE. BUT SOMETIMES, \nBURIED IN DA MARKUP, WE FIND DATA WORTH KEEPIN'!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
  "You’ll be browsing fragments and static pages once \nhosted by people long gone.": {
    "val": "YOU’LL BE BROWSIN' FRAGMENTS AN' STATIC PAGES ONCE \nHOSTED BY PEOPLE LONG GONE!",
    "excluded": "",
    "name": ""
  },
